<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Top Water Marine — Palm Coast, FL</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    /* ── Reset & base ── */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --navy:        #0b1826;
      --navy-mid:    #112236;
      --navy-light:  #1a3352;
      --panel:       #ffffff;
      --panel-off:   #f4f6f9;
      --accent:      #f5a623;   /* signal orange / safety yellow */
      --accent-dark: #c9841a;
      --text-primary: #0b1826;
      --text-muted:  #5a6a7e;
      --hairline:    #d0dae6;
      --mono:        'Space Mono', monospace;
      --sans:        'Inter', sans-serif;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--panel);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ── Concept banner ── */
    .concept-banner {
      background: #1e2a38;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2e4058;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px 5%;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #8fa8c4;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .concept-banner strong { color: var(--accent); }

    /* ── Nav ── */
    .nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(11, 24, 38, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1e3250;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 5%;
      height: 60px;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--panel);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--navy);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 9px 18px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 90vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 0 5% 72px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url('https://www.nowake.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/AdobeStock_272924653-scaled.jpeg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center 40%;
      filter: brightness(0.35) saturate(0.7);
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .hero-bg::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(11,24,38,0.95) 0%, rgba(11,24,38,0.4) 60%, transparent 100%);
    }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 780px; }

    .section-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .section-label::before {
      content: '';
      display: inline-block;
      width: 28px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--accent);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--panel);
    }
    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #b8cfe8;
      max-width: 540px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 52px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--navy);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .btn-ghost {
      color: var(--panel);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(245,166,35,0.08); }

    /* ── Proof strip ── */
    .proof-strip {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 20px 28px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }
    .proof-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3px;
    }
    .proof-number {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .proof-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8fa8c4;
    }
    .proof-divider {
      width: 1px;
      height: 40px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
    .proof-stars {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .proof-qual {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #b8cfe8;
      max-width: 180px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    /* ── Section wrapper ── */
    .section {
      padding: 88px 5%;
    }
    .section-white {
      background: var(--panel);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .section-off {
      background: var(--panel-off);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .section-dark {
      background: var(--navy-mid);
      color: var(--panel);
    }
    .section-navy {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--panel);
    }

    .section-header { margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-header p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 560px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .section-dark .section-header p,
    .section-navy .section-header p { color: #8fa8c4; }
    .section-dark .section-header h2,
    .section-navy .section-header h2 { color: var(--panel); }

    /* ── Hairline rule ── */
    hr.rule {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .section-dark hr.rule,
    .section-navy hr.rule { border-top-color: #1e3250; }

    /* ── Services grid ── */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2px;
      border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    }
    .service-card {
      padding: 32px 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
      background: var(--panel);
      position: relative;
      transition: background 0.18s;
    }
    .service-card:hover { background: #eef3fa; }
    .service-card-num {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .service-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .service-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .service-card-accent {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 3px;
      height: 0;
      background: var(--accent);
      transition: height 0.25s;
    }
    .service-card:hover .service-card-accent { height: 100%; }

    /* ── Photo interlude ── */
    .photo-band {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      height: 380px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .photo-band-img {
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }
    .photo-band-img img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.8) saturate(0.75);
      transition: filter 0.4s;
      display: block;
    }
    .photo-band-img:hover img { filter: brightness(0.95) saturate(1); }
    .photo-note {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 10px 5%;
      background: var(--panel-off);
    }

    /* ── Rating spotlight ── */
    .rating-spotlight {
      display: flex;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .rating-big {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .rating-big .num {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 5.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      line-height: 1;
      display: block;
    }
    .rating-big .stars-row {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      display: block;
      margin: 8px 0 6px;
    }
    .rating-big .source {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .rating-detail { flex: 1 1 300px; }
    .rating-detail h3 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .rating-detail p {
      font-size: 0.97rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .review-count-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: var(--accent);
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* ── Service area ── */
    .area-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1px;
      background: #1e3250;
      border: 1px solid #1e3250;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .area-cell {
      background: var(--navy-mid);
      padding: 22px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 5px;
    }
    .area-cell-name {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--panel);
    }
    .area-cell-detail {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #6f90b4;
    }
    .area-proposed-note {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    /* ── CTA block ── */
    .cta-block {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-block h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .cta-block p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #8fa8c4;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cta-block .btn-primary { font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 16px 36px; }

    /* ── Contact ── */
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2px;
      background: var(--hairline);
      border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    }
    .contact-cell {
      background: var(--panel);
      padding: 32px 28px;
    }
    .contact-cell-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .contact-cell-value {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .contact-cell-value.placeholder {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .map-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
    }
    .map-link:hover { color: var(--accent); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .footer {
      background: #060e17;
      padding: 44px 5% 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid #101e2e;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--panel);
    }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .footer-address {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #4e6880;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .footer-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .footer-nav a {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #4e6880;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid #101e2e;
      padding-top: 20px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #2e4558;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ── Numbered section marker ── */
    .num-marker {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .num-marker::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--accent);
      max-width: 40px;
    }
    .section-white .num-marker::after,
    .section-off .num-marker::after { background: var(--accent-dark); }
    .section-white .num-marker,
    .section-off .num-marker { color: var(--accent-dark); }

    /* ── Responsive ── */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .photo-band { grid-template-columns: 1fr; height: auto; }
      .photo-band-img { height: 220px; }
      .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .rating-spotlight { flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; }
      .proof-strip { gap: 20px; padding: 16px 20px; }
      .proof-divider { display: none; }
      .nav-logo { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .hero { padding-bottom: 52px; }
      .section { padding: 60px 5%; }
    }
  </style>
<style>
.ha-img-placeholder{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;background:#f4f4f5;border:1px dashed #d4d4d8;border-radius:8px;color:#71717a;font-size:12px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:80px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;animation:ha-img-pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.ha-img-placeholder.ha-failed{animation:none;opacity:.7}
@keyframes ha-img-pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.5}}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ha-img-placeholder{background:#27272a;border-color:#3f3f46;color:#a1a1aa}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ── Concept banner ── -->
<div class="concept-banner">
  <strong>Design Concept Only</strong> — Unaffiliated design concept — created as a proposal for Top Water Marine. Not an official site.
</div>

<!-- ── Nav ── -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-logo">Top <span>Water</span> Marine</div>
  <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Request Service</a>
</nav>

<!-- ── Hero ── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="section-label">Palm Coast, FL &nbsp;·&nbsp; Marine Service &amp; Repair</div>
    <h1>When Your Engine<br>Can't Wait, <em>We're</em><br>On the Water.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Top Water Marine keeps boats running on the Intracoastal and along the Flagler coast. Diagnostic, engine, maintenance, and seasonal work — done right.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Request Service</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn-ghost">View Services</a>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-strip">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-number">5.0</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Google Rating</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-divider"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-stars">★★★★★</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Perfect Score</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-divider"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-number">30</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Verified Reviews</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-divider"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-qual">Every review: five stars. No exceptions.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Photo band ── -->
<div class="photo-band">
  <div class="photo-band-img">
    <img
      src="https://www.nowake.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/AdobeStock_272924653-scaled.jpeg"
      alt="Outboard engine service — illustrative stock photography"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="photo-band-img">
    <img
      src="https://www.encirclephotos.com/wp-content/uploads/Florida-Fort-Lauderdale-Boats-All-Sizes-Intracoastal-Waterway-1440x961.jpg"
      alt="Florida Intracoastal Waterway — illustrative stock photography"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
</div>
<p class="photo-note">Photography is illustrative stock imagery representing the type of work and local waterways — not Top Water Marine's own facility or fleet.</p>

<!-- ── Rating spotlight ── -->
<section class="section section-off" id="rating">
  <div class="num-marker">02 &nbsp;/ Reputation</div>
  <div class="rating-spotlight">
    <div class="rating-big">
      <span class="num">5.0</span>
      <span class="stars-row">★★★★★</span>
      <span class="source">Google Reviews</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-detail">
      <h3>A perfect rating, earned thirty times over.</h3>
      <p>
        Top Water Marine holds a flawless 5.0 on Google — across all thirty verified reviews. In a trade where even a single frustrated customer can pull a score down, a perfect record built from genuine feedback is the clearest signal a marine business can send.
      </p>
      <p>
        No website. No ads. Word of mouth, repeat customers, and a five-star track record.
      </p>
      <span class="review-count-tag">30 Google Reviews &nbsp;·&nbsp; 5.0 Stars</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Services ── -->
<section class="section section-white" id="services">
  <div class="num-marker">03 &nbsp;/ Services</div>
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>Marine Service &amp; Repair</h2>
    <p>Core disciplines for keeping vessels seaworthy along the Palm Coast corridor. Contact for specifics on your make, model, and situation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="services-grid">

    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-card-accent"></div>
      <div class="service-card-num">SVC — 01</div>
      <h3>Engine Service &amp; Repair</h3>
      <p>Outboard and inboard engine work — from routine service to full fault diagnosis and mechanical repair. Get the full story on what's wrong before any work begins.</p>
